[{"id":"r-A1-01","title":"The New Neighbor","title_zh":"新邻居","title_ja":"新しいお隣さん","cat":"life","p":[[["A new family lives next door now.","现在隔壁住进了新的一家人。","今、隣に新しい家族が住んでいます。"],["They have a big white dog, and his name is Snow.","他们养了一只大白狗，名字叫“雪”。","大きな白い犬を飼っていて、名前はスノーです。"],["Every morning, Snow sits by our fence and waits for me.","每天早上，雪都坐在我家篱笆旁边等我。","毎朝、スノーはうちのフェンスのそばに座って、私を待っています。"]],[["Today I met the dog's owner, Mrs. Lee.","今天我见到了狗的主人，李太太。","今日、その犬の飼い主のリーさんに会いました。"],["She is a music teacher, and she plays the piano at night.","她是音乐老师，晚上会弹钢琴。","リーさんは音楽の先生で、夜にピアノを弾きます。"],["I like the music, so I open my window and listen.","我喜欢那音乐，所以会打开窗户听。","私はその音楽が好きなので、窓を開けて聞いています。"]]],"w":[["family","家庭；一家人","家族"],["next door","隔壁","隣（の家）"],["fence","篱笆；围栏","フェンス；柵"],["wait","等待","待つ"],["owner","主人；拥有者","飼い主；持ち主"],["piano","钢琴","ピアノ"],["window","窗户","窓"]],"q":[["What color is the dog?","white","black","brown","gray"],["What is Mrs. Lee's job?","She is a music teacher.","She is a doctor.","She is a bus driver.","She is a cook."],["What does the writer do at night?","Opens the window and listens to music","Plays the piano","Walks the dog","Watches TV"]],"ph":["photos/r-A1-01.jpg","Boivie","CC BY 4.0","https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Some_old_moving_boxes_from_Sweden.jpg"]},{"id":"r-A1-02","title":"The Lost Pencil Case","title_zh":"丢了的笔袋","title_ja":"なくした筆箱","cat":"school","p":[[["On Monday, Ken could not find his pencil case.","星期一，肯找不到他的笔袋了。","月曜日、ケンは筆箱が見つかりませんでした。"],["It was blue, with a small yellow star on it.","笔袋是蓝色的，上面有一颗黄色的小星星。","青い筆箱で、小さな黄色い星が付いていました。"],["He looked under his desk and in his bag, but it was not there.","他看了桌子下面和书包里，可是都没有。","机の下やかばんの中を見ましたが、ありませんでした。"]],[["At lunch, a girl from another class came to his room.","午饭时，别的班的一个女孩来到他的教室。","お昼に、ほかのクラスの女の子がケンの教室に来ました。"],["\"Is this yours?\" she asked.","“这是你的吗？”她问。","「これ、あなたの？」と彼女は聞きました。"],["It was his pencil case!","正是他的笔袋！","それはケンの筆箱でした！"],["She found it in the library, next to the window.","她是在图书馆的窗户旁边找到的。","彼女は図書館の窓のそばでそれを見つけたのです。"]]],"w":[["pencil case","笔袋；文具盒","筆箱；ペンケース"],["find","找到","見つける"],["star","星星","星"],["under","在……下面","〜の下に"],["another","另一个；别的","別の；ほかの"],["yours","你的（东西）","あなたのもの"],["library","图书馆","図書館"]],"q":[["What color was the pencil case?","blue","yellow","red","green"],["Where did the girl find it?","In the library","Under Ken's desk","In Ken's bag","In the music room"],["When did the girl come to Ken's room?","At lunch","In the morning","After school","On Tuesday"]],"ph":["photos/r-A1-02.jpg","ABX","CC BY-SA 4.0","https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:School_pencil_cases.jpg"]},{"id":"r-A1-03","title":"Sunday Pancakes","title_zh":"星期天的松饼","title_ja":"日曜日のパンケーキ","cat":"food","p":[[["Every Sunday, my dad makes pancakes for breakfast.","每个星期天，我爸爸都会做松饼当早饭。","毎週日曜日、父は朝ごはんにパンケーキを作ります。"],["He uses eggs, milk, flour, and a little sugar.","他用鸡蛋、牛奶、面粉和一点点糖。","卵と牛乳と小麦粉、それに砂糖を少し使います。"],["I help him and put everything together in a big bowl.","我给他帮忙，把所有东西放进一个大碗里拌在一起。","私は手伝って、大きなボウルで全部を合わせます。"]],[["My little sister likes bananas on her pancakes.","我妹妹喜欢在她的松饼上放香蕉。","妹は自分のパンケーキにバナナをのせるのが好きです。"],["I like butter on mine.","我喜欢在我的松饼上放黄油。","私は自分のパンケーキにバターをのせるのが好きです。"],["We eat slowly, talk a lot, and laugh.","我们慢慢地吃，聊很多，还会大笑。","私たちはゆっくり食べて、たくさん話して、笑います。"],["Sunday is my favorite day of the week.","星期天是我一周里最喜欢的一天。","日曜日は一週間でいちばん好きな日です。"]]],"w":[["breakfast","早饭","朝ごはん"],["egg","鸡蛋","卵"],["milk","牛奶","牛乳"],["sugar","糖","砂糖"],["bowl","碗；盆","ボウル；おわん"],["butter","黄油","バター"],["laugh","笑；大笑","笑う"],["favorite","最喜欢的","いちばん好きな"]],"q":[["Who makes the pancakes?","The writer's dad","The writer's mom","The writer's sister","The writer's grandma"],["What does the little sister like on her pancakes?","Bananas","Butter","Sugar","Chocolate"],["How does the writer help?","By putting everything together in a bowl","By buying the eggs","By washing the dishes","By cutting the bananas"]],"ph":["photos/r-A1-03.jpg","Brandon Martin-Anderson","CC BY-SA 2.0","https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Banana_on_pancake.jpg"]},{"id":"r-A1-04","title":"A Bird at My Window","title_zh":"窗边的小鸟","title_ja":"窓辺の鳥","cat":"nature","p":[[["In spring, a small brown bird came to my window.","春天，一只棕色的小鸟来到了我的窗边。","春に、小さな茶色の鳥が私の部屋の窓に来ました。"],["It started to build a nest there.","它开始在那里筑巢。","そこに巣を作り始めました。"],["It carried grass and little sticks in its mouth, again and again.","它一次又一次地用嘴叼来草和小树枝。","草や小さな枝をくちばしにくわえて、何度も何度も運びました。"]],[["Two weeks later, there were four small blue eggs in the nest.","两个星期后，巢里有了四个蓝色的小鸟蛋。","二週間後、巣の中に小さな青い卵が四つありました。"],["I don't open that window now.","现在我不开那扇窗户了。","今はその窓を開けていません。"],["Every morning, I watch the bird quietly from my bed.","每天早上，我都在床上静静地看着那只鸟。","毎朝、ベッドから静かにその鳥を見ています。"]]],"w":[["bird","鸟","鳥"],["window","窗户","窓"],["build","建造；筑","作る；建てる"],["carry","搬运；携带","運ぶ"],["grass","草","草"],["egg","蛋","卵"],["morning","早上","朝"],["quiet","安静的","静かな"]],"q":[["What did the bird build?","A nest","A house","A box","A window"],["How many eggs were in the nest?","four","two","three","five"],["When does the writer watch the bird?","Every morning","Every night","After school","On weekends"]],"ph":["photos/r-A1-04.jpg","Watts","Public domain","https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Robins_nest_eggs_bird_blue_(17092860149).jpg"]},{"id":"r-A1-05","title":"A Train to the Sea","title_zh":"坐火车去海边","title_ja":"電車で海へ","cat":"travel","p":[[["Last summer, Anna and her mom took a train to the sea.","去年夏天，安娜和妈妈坐火车去了海边。","去年の夏、アンナはお母さんと電車で海に行きました。"],["The trip was three hours long.","这趟旅程要三个小时。","電車の旅は三時間でした。"],["Anna sat by the window and looked at farms, rivers, and small towns.","安娜坐在窗边，看着农场、河流和小镇。","アンナは窓ぎわに座って、畑や川や小さな町をながめました。"]],[["At the beach, the water was cold, but the sun was warm.","在海边，水很凉，但是阳光很暖和。","海辺では、水は冷たかったけれど、日差しは暖かかったです。"],["They swam, ate sandwiches, and found pretty shells.","她们游了泳，吃了三明治，还找到了漂亮的贝壳。","二人は泳いで、サンドイッチを食べて、きれいな貝がらを見つけました。"],["Anna put the shells in her pocket.","安娜把贝壳放进了口袋。","アンナは貝がらをポケットに入れました。"],["On the train home, she slept all the way.","在回家的火车上，她一路都在睡觉。","帰りの電車では、アンナはずっと寝ていました。"]]],"w":[["train","火车","電車；列車"],["trip","旅行；旅程","旅行；旅"],["window","窗户","窓"],["farm","农场","農場；畑"],["river","河","川"],["beach","海滩；海边","海辺；浜辺"],["sandwich","三明治","サンドイッチ"],["pocket","口袋","ポケット"]],"q":[["How long was the train trip?","Three hours","One hour","Two hours","Five hours"],["What did Anna and her mom find at the beach?","Pretty shells","A dog","A hat","A big fish"],["What did Anna do on the train home?","She slept.","She read a book.","She ate sandwiches.","She looked at farms."]],"ph":["photos/r-A1-05.jpg","AgathaGR","CC BY-SA 4.0","https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Seashell_Sandy_Beach_(2).jpg"]},{"id":"r-A1-06","title":"Up Before the Sun","title_zh":"比太阳起得还早","title_ja":"太陽より早起き","cat":"work","lock":1,"ph":["photos/r-A1-06.jpg","Hooetbn Reecso Koewmn","CC BY-SA 4.0","https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:HK_SYP_%E8%A5%BF%E7%87%9F%E7%9B%A4_Sai_Ying_Pun_%E5%BE%B7%E8%BC%94%E9%81%93%E8%A5%BF_Des_Voeux_Road_West_yellow_shop_%E5%A4%A9%E5%A4%A9%E7%83%98%E7%84%99_Daily_Bread_Bakery_August_2020_SS2_05.jpg"]},{"id":"r-A1-07","title":"Walking to Work","title_zh":"走路上班","title_ja":"歩いて通勤","cat":"health","lock":1,"ph":["photos/r-A1-07.jpg","John Steven","CC BY-SA 2.0","https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Walking_to_work_-_geograph.org.uk_-_4536947.jpg"]},{"id":"r-A1-08","title":"Shoes Off, Please","title_zh":"请脱鞋","title_ja":"くつをぬいでください","cat":"culture","lock":1,"ph":["photos/r-A1-08.jpg","Blondinrikard Fröberg","CC BY 2.0","https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Please_take_off_your_shoes_(26343934025).jpg"]},{"id":"r-A1-09","title":"The Moon's Light","title_zh":"月亮的光","title_ja":"月の光","cat":"science","lock":1,"ph":["photos/r-A1-09.jpg","Vyacheslav Argenberg","CC BY 4.0","https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Andaman_Islands,_Full_moon_night,_Forest_by_the_sea_at_night.jpg"]},{"id":"r-A1-10","title":"The Cat and the Box","title_zh":"猫和箱子","title_ja":"ねことはこ","cat":"story","lock":1,"ph":["photos/r-A1-10.jpg","Chris Olszewski","CC BY-SA 4.0","https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Sleeping_cat_in_a_box,_Stawisza,_2026.jpg"]},{"id":"r-A1-11","title":"A Rainy Saturday","title_zh":"下雨的星期六","title_ja":"雨の土曜日","cat":"life","lock":1,"ph":["photos/r-A1-11.jpg","W.carter","CC BY-SA 4.0","https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Four_versions_of_a_floodlight_through_rain_on_a_window.jpg"]},{"id":"r-A1-12","title":"Art Class","title_zh":"美术课","title_ja":"図工の時間","cat":"school","lock":1,"ph":["photos/r-A1-12.jpg","Shixart1985","CC BY 2.0","https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Working_on_a_planning_session_with_stationery_items,_notebook,_and_colorful_pencils_on_a_wooden_desk.jpg"]},{"id":"r-A1-13","title":"Rice Balls for Lunch","title_zh":"午饭吃饭团","title_ja":"お昼はおにぎり","cat":"food","lock":1,"ph":["photos/r-A1-13.jpg","Corpse Reviver","CC BY-SA 3.0","https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Rice_balls_of_Circle_K_Sunkus.jpg"]},{"id":"r-A1-14","title":"Penguins","title_zh":"企鹅","title_ja":"ペンギン","cat":"nature","lock":1,"ph":["photos/r-A1-14.jpg","Ken FUNAKOSHI","CC BY-SA 2.0","https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Pygoscelis_papua_-Nagasaki_Penguin_Aquarium_-swimming_underwater-8a.jpg"]},{"id":"r-A1-15","title":"Where Is My Bag?","title_zh":"我的包在哪儿？","title_ja":"私のかばんはどこ？","cat":"travel","lock":1,"ph":["photos/r-A1-15.jpg","Silver Dovelet","CC BY-SA 4.0","https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Baggage_claim_carousel_2_with_display_screen_at_Terminal_3_of_Toronto_Pearson_International_Airport_(YYZ).jpg"]},{"id":"r-A1-16","title":"The Bus Driver","title_zh":"公交车司机","title_ja":"バスの運転手さん","cat":"work","lock":1,"ph":["photos/r-A1-16.jpg","Cayambe","CC BY-SA 3.0 lu","https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Luxemb_City_bus_stop_Badanstalt.jpg"]},{"id":"r-A1-17","title":"A Bad Cold","title_zh":"重感冒","title_ja":"ひどいかぜ","cat":"health","lock":1,"ph":["photos/r-A1-17.jpg","Evan-Amos","Public domain","https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Hot-and-Sour-Soup-Bowl.jpg"]},{"id":"r-A1-18","title":"Long Noodles, Long Life","title_zh":"长寿面","title_ja":"長いめん、長い命","cat":"culture","lock":1,"ph":["photos/r-A1-18.jpg","Francesca Cesa Bianchi, Milano","CC BY-SA 3.0 it","https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Italy_-_birthday_cake_with_candles_5.jpg"]},{"id":"r-A1-19","title":"Why Does Ice Float?","title_zh":"冰为什么会浮起来？","title_ja":"氷はなぜうくの？","cat":"science","lock":1,"ph":["photos/r-A1-19.jpg","Sam Altenberger","CC BY 4.0","https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Frozen_lake_surface_fractures.jpg"]},{"id":"r-A1-20","title":"The Yellow Umbrella","title_zh":"黄色的雨伞","title_ja":"黄色いかさ","cat":"story","lock":1,"ph":["photos/r-A1-20.jpg","Siddhesh Mangela","CC BY-SA 3.0","https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Guy_in_yellow,_Having_a_Full_Joy_of_the_rain..._-_panoramio.jpg"]},{"id":"r-A1-21","title":"Laundry Day","title_zh":"洗衣日","title_ja":"洗濯の日","cat":"life","lock":1,"ph":["photos/r-A1-21.jpg","Sgerbic","CC BY-SA 4.0","https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Winchester_Mystery_House_clothes_washing_machine.jpg"]},{"id":"r-A1-22","title":"The Class Goldfish","title_zh":"班里的金鱼","title_ja":"クラスの金魚","cat":"school","lock":1,"ph":["photos/r-A1-22.jpg","Kong of Lasers","CC BY-SA 4.0","https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Goldfish_in_Fish_Tank_(cropped).jpg"]},{"id":"r-A1-23","title":"Strawberry Picking","title_zh":"摘草莓","title_ja":"いちご狩り","cat":"food","lock":1,"ph":["photos/r-A1-23.jpg","South African Tourism from South Africa","CC BY 2.0","https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Strawberry_picking_at_Redberry_Farm,_George,_Western_Cape,_South_Africa_(20505910135).jpg"]},{"id":"r-A1-24","title":"The Frog in the Pond","title_zh":"池塘里的青蛙","title_ja":"池のカエル","cat":"nature","lock":1,"ph":["photos/r-A1-24.jpg","Martin Dawes","CC BY-SA 2.0","https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Frog_Spawn_on_Gembling_Pond_-_geograph.org.uk_-_6091443.jpg"]},{"id":"r-A1-25","title":"My First Plane Trip","title_zh":"第一次坐飞机","title_ja":"初めての飛行機","cat":"travel","lock":1,"ph":["photos/r-